.SH NAME
lfe_lfe \- Predefined LFE Lisp functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
This module provides a set of standard lisp functions which are included
in the LFE system.
These functions are predefined so there is no need to provide the
\f[CR]lfe\f[R] module when they are used.
